how tricky was what?

are you saying that the decision within NFSS was good or bad? I mean it
disallows / as part of a name but it resulted in (given the length) =
quite
readable names, didn't it? and in practice the use of / did not result =
in any
practical problems (or does the above statement mean you tried to call a
